  "claim_ceiling": "仅定义 detached owner helper 的引用身份与状态机；无产品 producer、授权、读取、复制粘贴、提交或权限验收声明。",
  "runner_contract": {
    "object_graph": "objects contains named object nodes; each node is instantiated once per case unless clone_of is specified, in which case runner creates a distinct JS object with equivalent properties.",
    "ref_resolution": "{\"ref\":\"objects.path\"} is resolved by the runner to the actual object reference before calling the helper; it is never passed as a string proof.",
    "current_context": "getCurrentContext returns the context object assembled from graph refs and scalar loader facts.",
    "assertions": "assert owner state, registration state, exact error, generation, registration ids, invalidation state, source_read=false, paste_commit=false and authorization_claim=none where specified."
  },
